     [38;5;246mstore.js / reminders.js / ui.js + index.html. No framework, no bundler, served on localhost. Reminder logic [39m
     [38;5;246munit-testable in Node. Upgradeable to a framework later without rewriting logic.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m A: single file, no tooling
     [38;5;246mEverything inline in index.html. Absolute minimum. No unit tests for the reminder logic — correctness verified by [39m
     [38;5;246mhand in the browser.[39m
